  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ConfigTreePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.env\"><code>ConfigTreePropertySource</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"ConfigTreePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.env\"><code>ConfigTreePropertySource</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>sourceDirectory</code> - the underlying source directory",
      "translation": "<code>sourceDirectory</code> - 底层源目录",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the origin of the given key or <code>null</code> if the origin cannot be\ndetermined.",
      "translation": "返回给定键的源，如果无法确定源则返回 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <code>true</code> if this lookup is immutable and has contents that will never\nchange.",
      "translation": "如果此查找是不可变的且其内容将永远不会改变，则返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>name</code> - the name of the property source",
      "translation": "<code>name</code> - 属性源名称",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Property values are returned as <a href=\"ConfigTreePropertySource.Value.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.env\"><code>ConfigTreePropertySource.Value</code></a> instances which allows them to be treated\neither as an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/InputStreamSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>InputStreamSource</code></a> or as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/CharSequence.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>CharSequence</code></a>. In addition, if\nused with an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> configured with an\n<a href=\"../convert/ApplicationConversionService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>ApplicationConversionService</code></a>, property values can be converted to a\n<code>String</code> or <code>byte[]</code>.",
      "translation": "属性值以 <a href=\"ConfigTreePropertySource.Value.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.env\"><code>ConfigTreePropertySource.Value</code></a>` 实例的形式返回，这使得它们既可以作为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/InputStreamSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>InputStreamSource</code></a>` 处理，也可以作为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/CharSequence.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>CharSequence</code></a>` 处理。此外，如果与配置了 <a href=\"../convert/ApplicationConversionService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>ApplicationConversionService</code></a>` 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>` 一起使用，属性值可以转换为 `<code>String</code>` 或 `<code>byte[]</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Directories are only scanned when the source is first created. The directory is not\nmonitored for updates, so files should not be added or removed. However, the contents\nof a file can be updated as long as the property source was created with a\n<a href=\"ConfigTreePropertySource.Option.html#ALWAYS_READ\"><code>ConfigTreePropertySource.Option.ALWAYS_READ</code></a> option. Nested directories are included in the source, but\nwith a <code>'.'</code> rather than <code>'/'</code> used as the path separator.",
      "translation": "目录仅在源首次创建时进行扫描。该目录不会监控更新，因此不应添加或删除文件。但是，只要属性源是使用 <a href=\"ConfigTreePropertySource.Option.html#ALWAYS_READ\"><code>ConfigTreePropertySource.Option.ALWAYS_READ</code></a>` 选项创建的，就可以更新文件的内容。嵌套目录包含在源中，但使用 `'.'` 而不是 `'/'` 作为路径分隔符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This property source is typically used to read Kubernetes <code>configMap</code> volume\nmounts.",
      "translation": "此属性源通常用于读取 Kubernetes <code>configMap</code> 卷挂载。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
